# "You may collect evidence 10 rather than pay the mana cost" - may: both answers (CR 118.9). With Emrakul, the Promised End (mana value 13) discarded by Faithless Looting on turn 3, evidence 10 is available, but Bot1 casts
# Night's Whisper with Mox Jet and Mox Pearl instead ({1}{B}), declining it: the graveyard keeps Emrakul, the Promised End. On turn 5 a second Night's Whisper is cast for evidence alone, exiling the Emrakul (13 is "10 or greater",
# CR 701.59a, one card is enough): no mana is paid (the Moxen stay untapped), and Bot1 draws and loses 2 life each time.

